#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of LLVM"
msgstr "Instalação do LLVM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:232
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Two additional tarballs <filename>llvm-cmake-&llvm-"
"version;.src.tar.xz</filename> and <filename>llvm-third-party-&llvm-"
"version;.src.tar.xz</filename> are needed by LLVM building system.  The "
"upstream expects them extracted at the same level as the "
"<filename>llvm-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz</filename> tarball, and the "
"extracted directories renamed to <filename "
"class=\"directory\">cmake</filename> and <filename "
"class=\"directory\">third-party</filename>.  Extract them and modify the "
"build system to avoid creating ambiguously-named directories outside the "
"<filename>llvm-&llvm-version;.src</filename> hierarchy:"
msgstr ""
"Dois tarballs adicionais <filename>llvm-cmake-&llvm-"
"version;.src.tar.xz</filename> e <filename>llvm-third-party-&llvm-"
"version;.src.tar.xz</filename> são necessários para o sistema de construção "
"do LLVM. O fluxo de desenvolvimento espera eles extraídos no mesmo nível, "
"como o tarball <filename>llvm-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz</filename>, e os "
"diretórios extraídos renomeados para <filename "
"class=\"directory\">cmake</filename> e <filename class=\"directory\">third-"
"party</filename>. Extraia-os e modifique o sistema de construção para evitar"
" criar diretórios ambiguamente nomeados fora da hierarquia "
"<filename>llvm-&llvm-version;.src</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:246
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../llvm-cmake-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz                              &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -xf ../llvm-third-party-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed '/LLVM_COMMON_CMAKE_UTILS/s@../cmake@cmake-&llvm-version;.src@'          \\\n"
"    -i CMakeLists.txt                                                &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed '/LLVM_THIRD_PARTY_DIR/s@../third-party@third-party-&llvm-version;.src@' \\\n"
"    -i cmake/modules/HandleLLVMOptions.cmake</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../llvm-cmake-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz                              &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -xf ../llvm-third-party-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed '/LLVM_COMMON_CMAKE_UTILS/s@../cmake@cmake-&llvm-version;.src@'          \\\n"
"    -i CMakeLists.txt                                                &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed '/LLVM_THIRD_PARTY_DIR/s@../third-party@third-party-&llvm-version;.src@' \\\n"
"    -i cmake/modules/HandleLLVMOptions.cmake</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:259
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"These two tarballs extract into directories named <filename "
"class='directory'>cmake-&llvm-version;.src</filename> and <filename "
"class='directory'>third-party-&llvm-version;.src</filename>, i.e. the "
"directory names lack the <literal>llvm-</literal> prefix."
msgstr ""
"Esses dois tarballs extraem nos diretórios chamados <filename "
"class='directory'>cmake-&llvm-version;.src</filename> e <filename "
"class='directory'>third-party-&llvm-version;.src</filename>, ou seja, os "
"nomes dos diretórios carecem do prefixo <literal>llvm-</literal>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:267
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>clang</application> into the source tree by running the"
" following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>clang</application> na árvore do fonte executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:271
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../clang-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz -C tools &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv tools/clang-&llvm-version;.src tools/clang</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../clang-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz -C tools &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv tools/clang-&llvm-version;.src tools/clang</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:275
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have downloaded <application>compiler-rt</application>, install it "
"into the source tree by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver baixado <application>compiler-rt</application>, instale-o na "
"árvore do fonte executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:279
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../compiler-rt-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz -C projects    &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv projects/compiler-rt-&llvm-version;.src projects/compiler-rt</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../compiler-rt-&llvm-version;.src.tar.xz -C projects    &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv projects/compiler-rt-&llvm-version;.src projects/compiler-rt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many Python scripts in this package which use "
"<command>/usr/bin/env python</command> to access the system Python which on "
"LFS is <xref linkend=\"python3\"/>. Use the following command to fix these "
"scripts:"
msgstr ""
"Existem muitos conjuntos de comandos sequenciais Python nesse pacote que "
"usam <command>/usr/bin/env python</command> para acessar o Python do "
"sistema, que no LFS é <xref linkend=\"python3\"/>. Use o seguinte comando "
"para corrigir esses conjuntos de comandos sequenciais:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:289
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>grep -rl '#!.*python' | xargs sed -i "
"'1s/python$/python3/'</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>grep -rl '#!.*python' | xargs sed -i "
"'1s/python$/python3/'</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:292
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Ensure installing the <command>FileCheck</command> program which is needed "
"by the test suite of some packages (for example <xref linkend='rust'/>):"
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de instalar o programa <command>FileCheck</command> que é "
"necessário para a suíte de teste de alguns pacotes (por exemplo <xref "
"linkend='rust'/>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:297
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed 's/utility/tool/' -i "
"utils/FileCheck/CMakeLists.txt</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed 's/utility/tool/' -i "
"utils/FileCheck/CMakeLists.txt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:300
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>LLVM</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>LLVM</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:304
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -v build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd       build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CC=gcc CXX=g++                               \\\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr           \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON         \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_ENABLE_FFI=ON                  \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release            \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON            \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB=ON             \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_ENABLE_RTTI=ON                 \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;AMDGPU\" \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_BINUTILS_INCDIR=/usr/include   \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_INCLUDE_BENCHMARKS=OFF         \\\n"
"      -D CLANG_DEFAULT_PIE_ON_LINUX=ON       \\\n"
"      -D CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_DIR=/etc/clang \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -v build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd       build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CC=gcc CXX=g++                               \\\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr           \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON         \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_ENABLE_FFI=ON                  \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release            \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON            \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB=ON             \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_ENABLE_RTTI=ON                 \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;AMDGPU\" \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_BINUTILS_INCDIR=/usr/include   \\\n"
"      -D LLVM_INCLUDE_BENCHMARKS=OFF         \\\n"
"      -D CLANG_DEFAULT_PIE_ON_LINUX=ON       \\\n"
"      -D CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_DIR=/etc/clang \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:344
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to run the test suite and you've downloaded compiler-rt, work "
"around an issue causing test failures when building LLVM with GCC and "
"<parameter>-D CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_DIR</parameter> and prevent some test"
" suite from using <command>ld.gold</command> that the LFS Binutils package "
"no longer provides:"
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar executar a suíte de teste e tiver baixado o compiler-rt, "
"contorne um problema que causa falhas de teste ao construir o LLVM com GCC e"
" <parameter>-D CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_DIR</parameter> e evite que algumas "
"suítes de teste usem <command>ld.gold</command> que o pacote Binutils do LFS"
" não mais fornece:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:351
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/config.has_no_default_config_flag/True/' \\\n"
"    -e 's/\"-fuse-ld=gold\"//'                       \\\n"
"    -i ../projects/compiler-rt/test/lit.common.cfg.py</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/config.has_no_default_config_flag/True/' \\\n"
"    -e 's/\"-fuse-ld=gold\"//'                       \\\n"
"    -i ../projects/compiler-rt/test/lit.common.cfg.py</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:357
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"LLVM test suite can produce many core dump files.  They will occupy a large "
"amount of disk space, and the core dump process can significantly slow down "
"the testing.  To test the results with core dump disabled, <phrase "
"revision='systemd'>ensure <xref linkend='systemd'/> and <xref "
"linkend='shadow'/> have been rebuilt with <xref linkend='linux-pam'/> "
"support (if you are interacting via a SSH or graphical session, also ensure "
"the <xref linkend='openssh'/> server or the desktop manager has been built "
"with <xref linkend='linux-pam'/>) and the current login session is started "
"after updating the <filename>/etc/pam.d/system-session</filename> file to "
"include <filename class='libraryfile'>pam_systemd.so</filename>, then "
"</phrase>issue:"
msgstr ""
"A suíte de testes do LLVM pode produzir muitos arquivos de despejo de core. "
"Eles ocuparão uma grande quantidade de espaço em disco e o processo de "
"despejo de core pode retardar significativamente a testagem. Para testar os "
"resultados com o despejo de core desabilitado, <phrase "
"revision='systemd'>certifique-se de que <xref linkend='systemd'/> e <xref "
"linkend='shadow'/> tenham sido reconstruídos com suporte a <xref "
"linkend='linux-pam'/> (se você estiver interagindo por meio de uma sessão "
"SSH ou gráfica, certifique-se também de que o servidor <xref "
"linkend='openssh'/> ou o gerenciador de área de trabalho tenha sido "
"construído com <xref linkend='linux-pam'/>) e a sessão de login atual seja "
"iniciada depois de atualizar o arquivo <filename>/etc/pam.d/system-"
"session</filename> para incluir <filename "
"class='libraryfile'>pam_systemd.so</filename> e, em seguida, </phrase>emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:372
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sh -c 'ulimit -c 0 &amp;&amp; ninja check-all'</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sh -c 'ulimit -c 0 &amp;&amp; ninja check-all'</userinput>"

#.  From core(5): "RLIMIT_CORE will be ignored if the system is
#.          configured to pipe core dumps to a program".  Here "the program"
#.          is systemd-coredumpd.  So we need some fancy systemd setting.
#.          -&ndash;user: Run it under per-user systemd manager, avoiding
#.                        the necessity of root privilege.
#.          -&nash;pty: Run it in a pseudo-terminal, so we can monitor the
#.                      process or interrupt it with Ctrl-C if we want.
#.          -d: Run it with $PWD as the working directory.
#.          -G: Delete the transient service unit even if the command fails,
#.              to prevent "systemctl -&ndash;user status" from reporting
#.              "degraded".
#.          -p LimitCORE=0: Disable core dump.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:388
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>systemctl   --user start dbus &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemd-run --user --pty -d -G -p LimitCORE=0 ninja check-all</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>systemctl   --user start dbus &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemd-run --user --pty -d -G -p LimitCORE=0 ninja check-all</userinput>"

#.  EDITORS - if you have more than 4 cores, use a cgroup to measure
#.       the elapsed time for the tests.  Also, libstdc++.a and perhaps
#. libstdc++fs.a
#.       are used by a couple of the link-static tests.
#.  https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/6beb6f34bc8e
#.  19.1.7: 75293 Passed, 28977 Unsupported, 364 Skipped,
#.                    133 Expectedly Failed
#.  To editors: it seems there is a more thorough test suite named
#.            "test-suite-x.y.z.src.tar.xz" on the GitHub release download
#.            page.  The usage of it is on
#.            https://llvm.org/docs/TestSuiteGuide.html.  It looks like we've
#.            never mentioned it in BLFS.
#.            Let's let it go.  llvm is complex enough as it is.  Adding
#.            the additional testsuite is IMO overkill.  - bdubbs
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:395
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <option>-jN</option> (N replaced with a number) is passed to "
"<command>ninja</command>, the tests will be built with N logical cores, but "
"run using all available logical cores.  Run the test command in a cgroup "
"(<phrase revision='systemd'>pass the <option>-p AllowedCPUs=...</option> "
"option to the <command>systemd-run</command> command, </phrase> read <xref "
"linkend='build-in-cgroup'/> for details) to limit the number of logical "
"cores for running the tests.  23 cfi tests are known to fail because their "
"assumption about the linker is not true with the BFD linker and we've had to"
" stop them from using the removed Gold linker.  One test named "
"<literal>DataFlowSanitizer-x86_64 :: atomic.cpp</literal> is known to fail "
"with gcc-15.1 or newer.  One test named <filename>SanitizerCommon-"
"asan-x86_64-Linux :: onprint.cpp</filename> is known to fail because the "
"unwinder in the sanitizer depends on the frame pointer that the default "
"configuration of Glibc does not enable.  One test named "
"<filename>Linux/clone_setns.cpp</filename> will fail if "
"<option>CONFIG_USER_NS</option> is not enabled in kernel configuration."
msgstr ""
"Se <option>-jN</option> (N substituído por um número) for passado para "
"<command>ninja</command>, os testes serão construídos com N núcleos lógicos,"
" mas executados usando todos os núcleos lógicos disponíveis. Execute o "
"comando de teste em um cgroup (<phrase revision='systemd'>passe a opção "
"<option>-p AllowedCPUs=...</option> para o comando <command>systemd-"
"run</command>, </phrase> leia-se <xref linkend='build-in-cgroup'/> para "
"detalhes) para limitar o número de núcleos lógicos para executar os testes. "
"23 testes cfi são conhecidos por falharem porque a suposição deles acerca do"
" vinculador não é verdadeira com o vinculador BFD e nós tivemos que impedi-"
"los de usar o vinculador Gold removido. Um teste chamado "
"<literal>DataFlowSanitizer-x86_64 :: atomic.cpp</literal> é conhecido por "
"falhar com o gcc-15.1 ou mais recente. Um teste chamado "
"<filename>SanitizerCommon-asan-x86_64-Linux :: onprint.cpp</filename> é "
"conhecido por falhar porque o desbobinador no sanitizador depende do "
"ponteiro de quadro que a configuração padrão do Glibc não habilita. Um teste"
" chamado <filename>Linux/clone_setns.cpp</filename> falhará se "
"<option>CONFIG_USER_NS</option> não estiver habilitado na configuração do "
"núcleo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:437
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:440
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:473
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:479
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_ENABLE_FFI=ON</parameter>: This switch allows "
"<application>LLVM</application> to use <application>libffi</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_ENABLE_FFI=ON</parameter>: Essa chave permite que o "
"<application>LLVM</application> use <application>libffi</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:485
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>: This switch builds the "
"libraries as static and links all of them into an unique shared one.  This "
"is the recommended way of building a shared library."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>: Essa chave constrói as "
"bibliotecas como estáticas e vincula todas elas em uma biblioteca "
"compartilhada exclusiva. Essa é a forma recomendada de construir uma "
"biblioteca compartilhada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:491
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: This switch enables "
"compiler optimizations in order to speed up the code and reduce its size.  "
"It also disables some compile checks which are not necessary on a production"
" system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: Essa chave habilita "
"otimizações do compilador para a finalidade de acelerar o código e reduzir o"
" tamanho dele. Também desabilita algumas verificações de compilação que não "
"são necessárias em um sistema de produção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:498
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;AMDGPU\"</parameter>: This switch"
" enables building for the same target as the host, and also for the r600 AMD"
" GPU used by the Mesa r600 and radeonsi drivers.  The default is all of the "
"targets. You can use a semicolon separated list. Valid targets are: host, "
"AArch64, AMDGPU, ARM, AVR, BPF, Hexagon, Lanai, LoongArch, Mips, MSP430, "
"NVPTX, PowerPC, RISCV, Sparc, SystemZ, VE, WebAssembly, X86, XCore, or all."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;AMDGPU\"</parameter>: Essa chave "
"habilita construir para o mesmo alvo que o anfitrião e, também, para a GPU "
"r600 da AMD, usada pelos controladores r600 e radeonsi do Mesa. O padrão é "
"todos os alvos. Você pode usar uma lista separada por ponto e vírgula. Os "
"alvos válidos são: host, AArch64, AMDGPU, ARM, AVR, BPF, Hexagon, Lanai, "
"LoongArch, Mips, MSP430, NVPTX, PowerPC, RISCV, Sparc, SystemZ, VE, "
"WebAssembly, X86, XCore ou all."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:509
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>: Used in conjunction with "
"<parameter>-D LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>, this switch enables "
"linking the tools against the shared library instead of the static ones.  It"
" slightly reduces their size and also ensures that llvm-config will "
"correctly use libLLVM-&llvm-maj-version;.so."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>: Usado em conjunção com "
"<parameter>-D LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>, essa chave habilita "
"vincular as ferramentas à biblioteca compartilhada em vez das estáticas. "
"Reduz ligeiramente o tamanho delas e também garante que \"llvm-config\" "
"usará corretamente \"libLLVM-&llvm-maj-version;.so\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:517
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_ENABLE_RTTI=ON</parameter>: This switch is used to build "
"LLVM with run-time type information. This is required for building <xref "
"linkend=\"mesa\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_ENABLE_RTTI=ON</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"construir LLVM com informações de tipo de tempo de execução. Isso é "
"necessário para construir <xref linkend=\"mesa\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:523
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_BINUTILS_INCDIR=/usr/include</parameter>: This switch is "
"used to tell the build system the location of binutils headers, which were "
"installed in LFS.  This allows the building of <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">LLVMgold.so</filename>, which is needed for building "
"programs with <command>clang</command> and Link Time Optimization (LTO)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_BINUTILS_INCDIR=/usr/include</parameter>: Essa chave é "
"usada para informar ao sistema de construção o local dos cabeçalhos do "
"binutils, que foram instalados no LFS. Isso permite a construção de "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">LLVMgold.so</filename>, que é necessário "
"para construir aplicativos com <command>clang</command> e Link Time "
"Optimization (LTO)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:532
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_INCLUDE_BENCHMARKS=OFF</parameter>: is used to disable "
"generation build targets for the LLVM benchmarks. This option requires "
"additional code that is not currently available."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D LLVM_INCLUDE_BENCHMARKS=OFF</parameter>: é usado para "
"desabilitar geração de alvos de construção para as avaliações do LLVM. Essa "
"opção exige código adicional que não está disponível atualmente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:539
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D CLANG_DEFAULT_PIE_ON_LINUX=ON</parameter>: makes "
"<option>-fpie</option> option the default when compiling programs.  Together"
" with the <xref linkend=\"gASLR\"/> feature enabled in the kernel, this "
"defeats some kind of attacks based on known memory layouts."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D CLANG_DEFAULT_PIE_ON_LINUX=ON</parameter>: torna a opção "
"<option>-fpie</option> o padrão ao compilar aplicativos. Junto com o recurso"
" <xref linkend=\"gASLR\"/> habilitado no núcleo, isso derrota alguns tipos "
"de ataques baseados em esquemas conhecidos de memória."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:546
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_DIR=/etc/clang</parameter>: makes "
"<command>clang</command> and <command>clang++</command> search <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc/clang</filename> for configuration files."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_DIR=/etc/clang</parameter>: faz com "
"que <command>clang</command> e <command>clang++</command> pesquisem "
"<filename class='directory'>/etc/clang</filename> para arquivos de "
"configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:553
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON</option>: if used instead of <parameter>-D "
"LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter> and <parameter>-D "
"LLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>, builds all the "
"<application>LLVM</application> libraries (about 60) as shared libraries "
"instead of static."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON</option>: se usado em vez de <parameter>-D "
"LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter> e <parameter>-D "
"LLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB=ON</parameter>, constrói todas as bibliotecas "
"<application>LLVM</application> (cerca de sessenta (60)) como bibliotecas "
"compartilhadas em vez de estáticas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:561
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D LLVM_ENABLE_DOXYGEN=ON -D LLVM_ENABLE_DOCS=ON</option>: Enables "
"the generation of browsable HTML documentation if you have installed <xref "
"linkend=\"doxygen\"/>. The documentation will be built at the end of the "
"build process."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D LLVM_ENABLE_DOXYGEN=ON -D LLVM_ENABLE_DOCS=ON</option>: Habilita "
"a geração de documentação HTML navegável se você tiver instalado <xref "
"linkend=\"doxygen\"/>. A documentação será construída no final do processo "
"de construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:570
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring LLVM"
msgstr "Configurando LLVM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:573
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:576
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you've built Clang, as the &root; user create two configuration files to "
"make <xref linkend='gSSP'/> enabled by default for <command>clang</command> "
"and <command>clang++</command>, so the default configuration of their SSP "
"feature will be consistent with <xref linkend='gcc'/>:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver construído o Clang, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, crie dois "
"arquivos de configuração para tornar <xref linkend='gSSP'/> habilitado por "
"padrão para <command>clang</command> e <command>clang++</command>, de forma "
"que a configuração padrão do recurso SSP deles seja consistente com <xref "
"linkend='gcc'/>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/llvm.xml:583
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /etc/clang &amp;&amp;\n"
"for i in clang clang++; do\n"
"  echo -fstack-protector-strong &gt; /etc/clang/$i.cfg\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /etc/clang &amp;&amp;\n"
"for i in clang clang++; do\n"
"  echo -fstack-protector-strong &gt; /etc/clang/$i.cfg\n"
"done</userinput>"

